  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 0.94,
      "e": 3.52,
      "text": "(upbeat music)"
    },
    {
      "s": 7.05,
      "e": 9.75,
      "text": "^- [Narrator] A CH-53E Super Stallion helicopter"
    },
    {
      "s": 9.75,
      "e": 12.21,
      "text": "^belonging to the 1st Marine Aircraft Wing"
    },
    {
      "s": 12.21,
      "e": 14.6,
      "text": "was conducting regularly scheduled training,"
    },
    {
      "s": 14.6,
      "e": 16.63,
      "text": "when it was forced to make an emergency landing"
    },
    {
      "s": 16.63,
      "e": 20.12,
      "text": "in a field outside Okinawa's northern training area,"
    },
    {
      "s": 20.12,
      "e": 21.62,
      "text": "after an in-flight fire"
    },
    {
      "s": 21.62,
      "e": 25.04,
      "text": "at approximately 5:20 p.m., October 11th."
    },
    {
      "s": 26.72,
      "e": 28.39,
      "text": "1st Lieutenant Joseph Butterfield,"
    },
    {
      "s": 28.39,
      "e": 29.92,
      "text": "III Marine Expeditionary Force"
    },
    {
      "s": 29.92,
      "e": 33.0,
      "text": "Communications Strategy and Operations Officer,"
    },
    {
      "s": 33.0,
      "e": 35.56,
      "text": "says the safety of the community and Marines"
    },
    {
      "s": 35.56,
      "e": 38.18,
      "text": "is a priority in any training conducted."
    },
    {
      "s": 38.18,
      "e": 39.5,
      "text": "- [Joseph] We're thankful that there were no injuries"
    },
    {
      "s": 39.5,
      "e": 40.86,
      "text": "to the crew or civilians,"
    },
    {
      "s": 40.86,
      "e": 43.33,
      "text": "and are also very grateful to the local first responders"
    },
    {
      "s": 43.33,
      "e": 45.04,
      "text": "who quickly put out the fire."
    },
    {
      "s": 45.04,
      "e": 47.41,
      "text": "We're currently working with the local and military police"
    },
    {
      "s": 47.41,
      "e": 48.49,
      "text": "to secure the site"
    },
    {
      "s": 48.49,
      "e": 51.25,
      "text": "and determine the most effective way to remove the aircraft."
    },
    {
      "s": 51.25,
      "e": 52.08,
      "text": "- [Narrator] The cause of the incident"
    },
    {
      "s": 52.08,
      "e": 54.0,
      "text": "is under investigation."
    },
    {
      "s": 54.0,
      "e": 55.92,
      "text": "Reporting from Okinawa, Japan,"
    },
    {
      "s": 55.92,
      "e": 58.31,
      "text": "I'm Lance Corporal Jonathan Pearson."
    },
    {
      "s": 58.31,
      "e": 59.97,
      "text": "(upbeat music)"
    }
  ],
